E=/home/user/Nicole-projects/elevenlabs/el.py
ST="Stylized 3D cartoon animation like a family animated feature film, vertical 9:16, smooth expressive character animation, consistent characters exactly as in the first frame. The macaw keeps the same beige bucket hat with its patch facing forward. Simple, calm camera. Only the character who is speaking moves its mouth; everyone else keeps the mouth closed while listening. All dialogue in Spanish with a Central American accent unless noted."
NEG="realistic, photorealistic, text, letters, subtitles, captions, watermark, distorted face, extra limbs, wrong character speaking, lip movement on listeners, morphing objects, two boxes, flicker"
v(){ o=$1; d=$2; s=$3; p=$4; [ -s v2/vid/$o.mp4 ] && return; python3 $E video "$ST $p" -o v2/vid/$o.mp4 --ar 9:16 --dur $d --res 4K --start $s --neg "$NEG" > v2/vid/$o.log 2>&1; }
b1(){
v A 8 sv_02.png "Warm sunrise kitchen. First, the macaw on the window sill above speaks to the woman below, its beak moving, saying: \"Doña Marta, este año la encomienda va al revés.\" The woman listens with her mouth closed, surprised and smiling. Then the woman looks up at the macaw and answers tenderly, her lips moving: \"Entonces llevale un pedacito de su casa a mi Carlos.\" The macaw listens with its beak closed and nods. Ambient: morning birds." &
v B1 8 sv_03.png "Coffee farm in the misty mountains. The kind farmer uncle in the straw hat hands the paper bag of coffee to the macaw and says warmly, his lips moving: \"Llevale este cafecito, para que se acuerde de las tacitas de café con pan que le daba su abuela.\" The macaw listens with its beak closed, moved, holding the bag with both wings. Ambient: birds, leaves." &
v C 8 sv_04.png "Bakery. The macaw quickly hides a rosquilla behind its back with an innocent smile, beak closed. The lady with glasses above looks at it over her glasses and scolds, her lips moving: \"¡Ey! Esas son para Carlos...\" then softens, smiles and hands the macaw another rosquilla, saying: \"pero tomá una, para el viaje.\" The macaw's eyes sparkle with happiness, beak closed. Ambient: shop." &
v D 8 sv_05.png "Neighborhood afternoon. The young woman in the middle holds up her university ID and shouts happily to the camera, her lips moving: \"¡Decile que ya entré a la U, y que es gracias a él!\" Then the kids shout together: \"¡Te queremos, tío!\" Then the macaw raises the vintage camera and says cheerfully, its beak moving: \"¡Digan nacatamal!\" and the flash pops; everybody laughs. Ambient: laughter, camera click." &
v E 8 sv_06.png "Night kitchen, warm lamp. The woman finishes recording on her phone, puts it down, looks at the macaw on the table with tears in her eyes and says softly, her lips moving: \"Cuidámelo mucho, ¿va?\" The macaw, finishing tying the rope bow on the single box, looks at her and answers seriously and tenderly, its beak moving: \"Con mi vida, doña Marta.\" Ambient: quiet night crickets." &
v F 6 sv_07.png "Inside an airplane at night. The macaw sits buckled in the window seat hugging the tied box, looks down at the box and whispers tenderly, its beak moving: \"Aguantá, nacatamal... ya casi llegamos.\" Outside the window clouds pass and snowflakes appear. Gentle airplane hum." &
wait; }
b2(){
v G 8 sv_08.png "Airport customs. The serious officer leans down and asks in English, his lips moving: \"Anything to declare?\" Then he keeps his mouth CLOSED while the macaw on the counter smiles innocently and answers, its beak moving: \"Solo amor... y un nacatamal.\" The officer sniffs the air, his face softens into a smile and he says in English, lips moving: \"Merry Christmas.\" and waves the macaw through. Ambient: airport murmur." &
v H 6 v2/h_start.png "Apartment hallway at night. The tired man looks at the box, crouches and picks it up, surprised, and says quietly, his lips moving: \"¿Y esto?... ¿De Honduras?\" Through the window on the right wall, the macaw peeks in and quickly ducks to hide, beak closed. Ambient: quiet hallway, wind outside." &
v I 8 sv_10.png "Small blue-lit apartment, the man is alone in the room. He opens the box; warm golden light glows on his face; he lifts the bag of coffee, smells it, closes his eyes and says softly with emotion, his lips moving: \"Huele a la casa de mi abuela...\" A tear rolls down his cheek and he smiles. Ambient: quiet room." &
v J 6 v2/j_start.png "Small living room at night. The man hugs the framed photo to his chest and says with a broken voice, his lips moving: \"Gracias, mamá... Feliz Navidad.\" Outside the window on the right, the macaw, beak closed, gives a thumbs-up with its wing, then turns and flies away into the falling snow; tiny fireworks in the distance." &
wait; }
b3(){ v B2 6 v2/b1_last.png "Coffee farm. The macaw opens the paper bag, sniffs the coffee, closes its eyes blissfully and floats gently up off the ground on a golden swirl of coffee aroma, cartoon style, and says delighted, its beak moving: \"¡Con este olor va a sentir que está en Marcala!\" The farmer laughs with his mouth closed. Ambient: birds." ; }
b4(){
v C 8 sv_04.png "One single continuous shot, no camera cuts. Bakery. The macaw quickly hides a rosquilla behind its back with an innocent smile, beak closed. The lady with glasses above looks at it over her glasses and says firmly, lips moving, ONLY: \"¡Ey! Esas son para Carlos...\" Then she pauses in silence with her mouth closed, softens, smiles, and hands the macaw one rosquilla while saying, lips moving, ONLY: \"pero tomá una, para el viaje.\" She says nothing else. The macaw's eyes sparkle with happiness, beak closed. Ambient: shop." &
v E 8 sv_06.png "One single continuous shot with the same camera angle the whole time, no cuts, no close-ups, no text on screen. Night kitchen, warm lamp. The woman finishes recording on her phone and puts it down, then looks down at the macaw on the table with tears in her eyes and says softly, lips moving, ONLY: \"Cuidámelo mucho, ¿va?\" Right after, the macaw, who is tying the rope bow on the single box, looks up at her and answers tenderly, beak moving, ONLY: \"Con mi vida, doña Marta.\" She smiles with her mouth closed and puts her hand on her heart. Ambient: quiet night crickets." &
wait; }
